  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 5 minutes, stirring now and then, until softened.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, paprika, ground coriander and chilli. Cook for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste, canned tomatoes, water, salt and black pepper. Simmer for 8 to 10 minutes until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Add the prawns and cook for 3 to 4 minutes, turning once, until pink, opaque and just cooked through.",
    "Stir through the chopped coriander and lemon juice, then taste and adjust the seasoning before serving hot."
